sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Citizen / Guest
    participant UI as Scanner Page (ecolink-web)
    participant ScanCtrl as WasteScanController
    participant AiHttp as AiVisionHttpClient
    participant FastAPI as Ecolink.AiService
    participant FbSvc as AiFeedbackService
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2 Storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over User,DB: U-04: Quet anh (luu SHA-256 + tu thu thap OOD) & Gui bao cao phan loai sai

    User->>UI: Tai anh rac len Scanner & chon model
    UI->>ScanCtrl: POST /api/v1/waste-scan/classify (file, model)
    ScanCtrl->>AiHttp: ClassifyWasteImageAsync(stream, fileName, model)
    AiHttp->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/classify
    FastAPI-->>AiHttp: predictedLabel, confidence, isOod, detectedObjects
    AiHttp-->>ScanCtrl: AiScanResultDto

    ScanCtrl->>FbSvc: RecordScanHistoryAsync(bytes, userId, aiResult)
    FbSvc->>FbSvc: Tinh SHA-256 hex (64 ky tu)
    FbSvc->>R2: Upload ai-scans/yyyy/MM/sha256.ext (fallback local an toan)
    R2-->>FbSvc: imageUrl
    FbSvc->>DB: INSERT ai_scan_histories
    opt IsOutOfDistribution == true OR confidence < 0.60
        FbSvc->>DB: Check ImageSha256 & INSERT ai_dataset_items (LowConfidenceAuto, Unlabeled)
    end
    FbSvc-->>ScanCtrl: (scanId, imageUrl)
    ScanCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK (scanId, imageUrl, aiResult, sortingGuide)

    User->>UI: Nhan Bao nhan sai, chon nhan dung & nhap ghi chu
    UI->>ScanCtrl: POST /api/v1/waste-scan/feedback (scanId, userReportedLabel, note)
    ScanCtrl->>FbSvc: SubmitFeedbackAsync(userId, dto)
    FbSvc->>DB: Check WasteCategory Active (BR-CLS-02)
    alt Nhan khong ton tai hoac Inactive
        FbSvc-->>ScanCtrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-CLS-02)
        ScanCtrl-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
    else ScanId da duoc bao cao truoc do
        FbSvc-->>ScanCtrl: ConflictException (BR-CLS-05)
        ScanCtrl-->>UI: 409 Conflict
    else Hop le
        FbSvc->>DB: INSERT ai_feedback_logs (Status=Pending, ImageSha256)
        FbSvc-->>AiHttp: Best-effort POST /api/v1/feedback
        ScanCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK (MSG-CLS-06, reportId)
    end

    opt Nguoi dung da dang nhap xem lich su bao cao (U-04)
        UI->>ScanCtrl: GET /api/v1/waste-scan/feedback/me
        ScanCtrl->>FbSvc: GetMyFeedbackReportsAsync(userId)
        FbSvc->>DB: SELECT ai_feedback_logs WHERE user_id = userId (BR-CLS-08)
        ScanCtrl-->>UI: 200 OK PagedResult
    end
